/**
 * Canonicalize a shell segment to the token string the shell would actually
 * execute: remove quote DELIMITERS while joining the fragments they wrap (so
 * `"nix"` → `nix`, `n"i"x` → `nix`, `n'i'x` → `nix`), and drop backslash
